    "summary": "When a rule has you put one model where another was, or swap one model for another:\n\n1. Mark the point beneath the old model's [base centre](vsdata:core-rule/units-and-models).\n2. Set the new model down with its base centre directly over that mark.\n\nFor a **FRAME** unit, use the central axis instead of the base centre. If the new model would end up stacked on another model or overhanging the battlefield edge, place it as close to the mark as possible instead.",
